Awesome! What I need is a list of those of us who are "yes" and
"maybe" for attendance. My scheduling team needs that estimate, to
choose the size of the Lojban room.

Currently "yes":
Matt Arnold (epkat)
Robin Lee Powell (camgusmis)
Stephen Weeks (tene)
Elmo Todurov
Bruce Webber
Red

Currently "maybe"
Pierre Abbat (phma)
Shaun Klein

Some Lojbanists have expressed interest in sharing a hotel room. Our
hotel, the Crowne Plaza, is almost completely out of hotel rooms. They
might be all reserved since the last time I checked. So you might have
to be in one of the overflow hotels. They are on the same block, less
than five minutes walk. The cluster of hotels is next to the airport,
so they all have shuttle service.

Please, let me know of any questions about registration, travel,
lodging, restaurants, or delivering presentations!

Also it would look really good on the Lojban.org website to show a
nice long list of Lojbanists you could meet there.

Thank you so much!

-Eppcott

P.S. For Robin, I'm putting on the schedule an hour and a room, where
only Lojban will be spoken. Spectators will be given pads of paper on
which to write any English that they need.


